  "scenario": "Ana is preparing for a job interview at a small company. She talks with her friend about her skills, her experience, and what she can do. She practices describing herself with words like helpful and creative, and she thinks about her qualifications and her success in past jobs.",
  "introduction_md": "## Describiendo tus habilidades y cualificaciones\n\nEn esta lección vas a aprender a hablar sobre tus **skills** (habilidades) y **qualifications** (cualificaciones) en inglés. Esto es muy útil para entrevistas de trabajo, para hablar con tu jefe o para conocer gente nueva.\n\nVas a practicar:\n\n- Cómo decir **I have experience in...** (Tengo experiencia en...)\n- Adjetivos para describirte: **helpful** (servicial), **creative** (creativo/a)\n- Palabras clave como **practice** (práctica), **expert** (experto/a) y **success** (éxito)\n\nCon estas herramientas podrás presentarte mejor y contar qué sabes hacer. ¡Vamos a empezar!",
  "intro_target": "## Describing your skills and qualifications\n\nIn this lesson, you will learn to talk about your **skills** and **qualifications** in English. This is very useful for job interviews, to talk with your boss, or to meet new people.\n\nYou will practice:\n\n- How to say **I have experience in...**\n- Adjectives to describe yourself: **helpful**, **creative**\n- Key words like **practice**, **expert**, and **success**\n\nWith these tools, you can present yourself better and say what you know how to do. Let's start!",
